2026-11-10T04:14:49.8817553Z # Theorems.lean from the compiled library, and fails unless this file holds
2026-11-10T04:14:49.8818200Z # an identical block. A pull request's own edits to this file do not count
2026-11-10T04:14:49.8818777Z # until they are merged. See "Statement binding" in formal/README.md.
2026-11-10T04:14:49.8819226Z #
2026-11-10T04:14:49.8819597Z # Each block: `theorem NAME sha256:HASH`, then the theorem's statement and
2026-11-10T04:14:49.8820260Z # the library declarations it depends on, pretty-printed (every argument and
2026-11-10T04:14:49.8821183Z # universe level shown, no notation, proofs as `⋯`). HASH is SHA-256 over the
2026-11-10T04:14:49.8821726Z # exact serialization of the same declarations (AxiomReport.lean,
2026-11-10T04:14:49.8822255Z # `statementClosure`). Generate blocks with scripts/propose-statements.sh;
2026-11-10T04:14:49.8822747Z # review the text against the sources.
